  { caixa: 'Beware of myths', texto: 'The pyramids were **not** built by slaves or by extraterrestrials: they were the work of organised, paid Egyptians, as the workers’ towns (Kahun in the Middle Kingdom) and the tombs of their foremen show. Theories about lost civilisations or alien help have no archaeological basis.' }
